 way past F\u00e9lix but were then unable to close in on leading Moll who was make ing steady 2m10s laps.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":9},{"lap":5,"text":"Czaykowski and Etancelin found a way past F\u00e9lix but were then unable to close in on leading Moll who was make ing steady 2m10s laps.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":9},{"lap":7,"text":"Lehoux, from a poor grid position at the back, begins working his way forward as drivers start making frequent stops; Dreyfus stops several times with eye trouble.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":7,"text":"Lehoux, from a poor grid position at the back, begins working his way forward as drivers start making frequent stops; Dreyfus stops several times with eye trouble.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":11,"text":"On lap 11 Etancelin pitted from his third position as he had to have snow removed from his plug leads. He lost two laps to Moll and fell down to 13th while Gaupillat took over the third position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":11,"text":"On lap 11 Etancelin pitted from his third position as he had to have snow removed from his plug leads. He lost two laps to Moll and fell down to 13th while Gaupillat took over the third position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":16,"text":"Lehoux made great progress and his 16th lap was the fastest of the race thus far.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":16,"text":"Lehoux made great progress and his 16th lap was the fastest of the race thus far.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":20,"text":"By lap 20 Lehoux is fourth behind Moll, Czaykowski and Gaupillat.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":20,"text":"By lap 20 Lehoux is fourth behind Moll, Czaykowski and Gaupillat.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":25,"text":"On lap 25 the snow finally stopped falling and visibility became better while the track conditions became, just worse.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":25,"text":"On lap 25 the snow finally stopped falling and visibility became better while the track conditions became, just worse.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":27,"text":"Lehoux catches Gaupillat and passes him for third.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":27,"text":"Lehoux catches Gaupillat and passes him for third.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":30,"text":"Lehoux passes Czaykowski for second; Moll then pits and falls to third.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":30,"text":"Lehoux passes Czaykowski for second; Moll then pits and falls to third.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":32,"text":"Lombard and Brunet had retired, so there were 13 cars still on the track where the sun now had started to shine.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":32,"text":"Lombard and Brunet had retired, so there were 13 cars still on the track where the sun now had started to shine.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":35,"text":"At 35 laps Lehoux had opened up a half a minute gap to a struggling Czaykowski, who had Moll right behind him.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":35,"text":"At 35 laps Lehoux had opened up a half a minute gap to a struggling Czaykowski, who had Moll right behind him.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":38,"text":"In the slush it takes Moll a long time to get past Czaykowski; when he does, Lehoux is a minute ahead.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":38,"text":"In the slush it takes Moll a long time to get past Czaykowski; when he does, Lehoux is a minute ahead.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":40,"text":"Etancelin, recovering from his early stop, sets the fastest lap so far and is up to tenth after 40 laps.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":40,"text":"Etancelin, recovering from his early stop, sets the fastest lap so far and is up to tenth after 40 laps.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":45,"text":"On lap 45 Czaykowski had to give way to Bouriat as well. Bouriat took up the chase on Moll and closed the gap down to a few seconds but then he got dirt in his eyes and had to slow down.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":4},{"lap":45,"text":"On lap 45 Czaykowski had to give way to Bouriat as well. Bouriat took up the chase on Moll and closed the gap down to a few seconds but then he got dirt in his eyes and had to slow down.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":4},{"lap":50,"text":"On lap 50 Gaupillat and Morand were out of the race. Etancelin and Dreyfus were putting in a great spurt and passed Chaykowski after having both equalled the lap record severl times.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":50,"text":"On lap 50 Gaupillat and Morand were out of the race. Etancelin and Dreyfus were putting in a great spurt and passed Chaykowski after having both equalled the lap record severl times.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":58,"text":"Etancelin laps in 2m03s, then 2m01s on lap 58, the best so far.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":58,"text":"Etancelin laps in 2m03s, then 2m01s on lap 58, the best so far.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":61,"text":"Czaykowski and F\u00e9lix retire; Bouriat stops to clean his eyes, and Etancelin and Dreyfus move up to third and fourth.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":61,"text":"Czaykowski and F\u00e9lix retire; Bouriat stops to clean his eyes, and Etancelin and Dreyfus move up to third and fourth.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":70,"text":"Etancelin, cheered on by the spectators, now took up the chase on Moll with Dreyfus still following him.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":70,"text":"Etancelin, cheered on by the spectators, now took up the chase on Moll with Dreyfus still following him.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":80,"text":"Lehoux wins, a minute ahead of Moll; Etancelin, closing, is third, 18 seconds behind Moll.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":80,"text":"Lehoux wins, a minute ahead of Moll; Etancelin, closing, is third, 18 seconds behind Moll.","q":false,"c":0}]}